{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]O Thou who [F7]hear[Bb]est [Eb]ev[Bb]ery [C7]heart[F7]felt [Bb]prayer,
[Gm]With [A]Thy [A7]rich [Dm]grace, [G7]Lord, [F]all our [C7]hearts pre[F]pare;
[F]Thou art our [F7]life, [Eb]Thou [F]art [Eb]our [F7]love [Eb]and [F7]light,
[Bb]O[F7]let [Bb]this [Eb]Sabbath [Bb]hour [Eb]with [Bb]Thee [F7]be [Bb]bright. [Eb]A[Bb]men.
{end_of_verse}
